[statement]
A candidate whose dependency a decision already made does not meet is
passed over: `lib`, a real name, is decided first, for 2.0, so `p1`, which
needs `lib<2`, is passed over for `v`, and `p2` is installed.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v lib

P:p1
V:1
p:v
k:100
D:lib<2

P:p2
V:1
p:v
k:10

P:lib
V:1.0

P:lib
V:2.0


[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p2 1
install lib 2.0
install app 1
